% Vacuity probe for common_parent (2026-07-28 verification run; finding #3 in
% zettelkasten/reports/2026-07-28-model-evidence-findings.md). Shadow relations may
% not be referenced from non-shadow contexts, so the body of common_parent
% (vc_metamodel.refinery:183, retired 2026-08-03 per DEC-common_parent_retired on the strength of
% this probe) is inlined verbatim into witness/2. The probe is therefore
% self-contained and still reproducible after the retirement. Builds on the
% known-SAT CSOK instance (csok_instance, no governance_conflict) with widened
% scope so the solver may add structure, and forces every generated model to
% contain a witness pair via error missing_witness. If generate reports
% unsatisfiability, no model within scope contains a common_parent pair: the
% shadow predicate is vacuous. Control: probe_common_parent_control.problem
% (identical, error line commented out) must be SAT.

import vc_metamodel.
import csok_instance.

pred witness(Prop p1, Prop p2) <->
    p1 != p2,
    Prop::trace(p1, cp1),
    Prop::trace(p2, cp2),
    Claim::source(cp1, e1),
    Claim::source(cp2, e2),
    e1 == e2.

pred some_witness() <-> witness(_, _).

error missing_witness() <-> !some_witness().

scope node = 29..40.
